{% # theme-check-disable MissingAsset %}
<div class="gs" data-story-cinema>
<div class="gs-progress" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<section class="gs-hero"><video muted autoplay loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Emerald silk film"><source src="{{ 'silk-drift.mp4' | asset_url }}" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="gs-hero-shade"></div><div class="gs-hero-copy"><p class="gs-kicker">The house of Gorony / Our story</p><h1>A family name.<br><em>A world of feeling.</em></h1><p>Gorony began at home, with one promise: nothing carries the family name unless the family would wear it themselves.</p><a href="#gs-letter" class="gs-link">Enter our story <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="gs-hero-bottom"><span>EST. MMXXVI</span><span>CRAFTED FOR HER.</span><button type="button" class="gs-motion" aria-pressed="false">Pause motion</button></div></section>
<section class="gs-letter gs-wrap" id="gs-letter"><div class="gs-letter-title gs-reveal"><p class="gs-kicker">01 / The beginning</p><h2>It started<br><em>with a feeling.</em></h2><span class="gs-fine-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="gs-letter-caption">A letter from the founder</p></div><div class="gs-letter-body"><p class="gs-lead gs-reveal">“I wanted to build something I could put my family’s name on.”</p><p class="gs-reveal">Gorony did not begin as a business plan. It began at home, watching the women in my life read the back of a bottle and wonder what half the words meant, and why something that cost so much could feel so thoughtless.</p><p class="gs-reveal">I wanted to build something I could put my family's name on. Not a hundred products. A handful, made properly, tested on our own skin at our own kitchen table, and offered only when we believed each one could stand with the best in its category.</p><p class="gs-reveal">The crest on every piece carries three letters. S for me, I for my wife Ilianna, and G for the name we share. The first lipstick shade is named after her, because she was the first woman this house was ever built for.</p><p class="gs-reveal">This is a small house, and it will grow slowly on purpose. If you are here before the first collection, you are early, and being early will always mean something at Gorony.</p><div class="gs-signature gs-reveal">Sina Gorony<span>FOUNDER</span></div></div></section>
<section class="gs-crest"><div class="gs-crest-stage"><div class="gs-crest-art"><span class="gs-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="gs-ring gs-ring-two" aria-hidden="true"></span><img src="{{ 'gorony-mark-v2.png' | asset_url }}" width="400" height="400" alt="Gorony family crest: S, I and G"><p class="gs-kicker">Three letters. One promise.</p></div></div><div class="gs-crest-chapters"><article class="gs-chapter gs-reveal"><p class="gs-kicker">02 / The crest</p><span class="gs-letter-mark" aria-hidden="true">S</span><h2>Sina.<br><em>The beginning.</em></h2><p>For Sina, who founded the house. A name on a label, and a personal promise behind it.</p></article><article class="gs-chapter gs-reveal"><span class="gs-letter-mark" aria-hidden="true">I</span><h2>Ilianna.<br><em>The first muse.</em></h2><p>For Ilianna, whose shelf every formula must earn a place on. The first woman this house was built for.</p></article><article class="gs-chapter gs-reveal"><span class="gs-letter-mark" aria-hidden="true">G</span><h2>Gorony.<br><em>The name we share.</em></h2><p>For the family name that goes on the label only when the work deserves it.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="gs-film"><div class="gs-film-frame"><video muted autoplay loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Gold and emerald Gorony film"><source src="{{ 'aurum-film.mp4' | asset_url }}" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="gs-film-copy gs-reveal"><p class="gs-kicker">03 / The philosophy</p><h2>Considered.<br>Personal.<br><em>Gorony.</em></h2><p>Beauty that earns a place in your life.</p></div><span class="gs-film-index" aria-hidden="true">LIGHT / TEXTURE / FEELING</span></div></section>
<section class="gs-principles gs-wrap"><div class="gs-reveal"><p class="gs-kicker">The things we come back to</p><h2>A little more thought.<br><em>In every detail.</em></h2></div><div class="gs-principle-list"><article class="gs-reveal"><span>01</span><div><h3>Made personal.</h3><p>Skincare and makeup are part of daily life. We believe choosing them should feel personal, considered, and entirely your own.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article><article class="gs-reveal"><span>02</span><div><h3>Worth the wait.</h3><p>If it is almost right, it waits. That is the spirit behind the house, and the standard we return to.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article><article class="gs-reveal"><span>03</span><div><h3>Rooted in family.</h3><p>Our name connects every piece to the people behind it. From the first idea to the daily ritual, it starts at home.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article></div></section>
<section class="gs-finale"><p class="gs-kicker gs-reveal">The story continues with you</p><h2 class="gs-reveal">Welcome<br><em>to the house.</em></h2><a class="gs-button gs-reveal" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Explore the collection <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="gs-news gs-reveal"><h3>A letter, now and then.</h3><p>New pieces, private offers, and news from Gorony.</p>{% form 'customer', class: 'gs-form' %}{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p role="status">Welcome to the house. You are on the list.</p>{% else %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}<input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter"><label for="gs-email">Email address</label><div><input id="gs-email" type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Your email address" required><button type="submit" aria-label="Join the Gorony house list">Join us ↗</button></div><p class="gs-consent">By subscribing, you agree to receive marketing emails. Unsubscribe anytime. <a href="{{ shop.privacy_policy.url }}">Privacy policy</a></p>{% endif %}{% endform %}</div></section>
<div class="gs-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>
{% stylesheet %}
